{"turn_id": "d19-t1", "session_id": "d19", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "model_type", "text": "该论文提出的是一个深度神经模型，基于上下文和实体链接结果两方面信息来进行预测。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-d31ec43506655415203bffe9"}]}, {"key": "model_inputs", "text": "模型基于上下文、mention 字符串以及通过实体链接从知识库获得的类型信息来灵活预测标签。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-23d2fdeeb3e49fb0893362f3"}]}, {"key": "components_bilstm_mlp", "text": "模型包含 BiLSTM 层和 MLP；其中变体 Ours (NonDeep) 使用一层 BiLSTM 并用 dense 层替代 MLP。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-4ea9198a20a3bd90e19484db"}]}, {"key": "full_model_el", "text": "完整模型 Ours (Full) 使用作者自有的基于 commonness 的实体链接方法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-4ea9198a20a3bd90e19484db"}]}, {"key": "training_loss", "text": "通过使用 hinge loss 的变体并在训练中引入噪声，缓解对弱标注训练数据的过拟合问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-bee14e88c20dfa401e81466f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d19-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
